<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel gunmen shot at a student bus in Mexico, killing multiple passengers, and attacked a school bus in Sinaloa, injuring the driver. Federal authorities arrested an alleged cartel leader linked to a deadly car bombing and seized weapons and a stolen truck from Pacific cartel members in Chiapas. A former state attorney general faces treason charges after two CIA agents were killed in northern Mexico, and a Texas man was indicted for supplying firearms to the Sinaloa Cartel. The United States is pressuring Mexico to deliver a security win ahead of the midterm elections. The conflict’s historical toll includes 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNVEVFQmJseGNjZnVKUGtmRzlmdGRqdHA1Z1Bab1lyVzhEMF94WjN3dzgwR09TSUZ2SENNcmpDVlUyX3FPUkZCM0x2dlI5Q29oQnA5Y3RjU0R6ZHdkYVF1MmxHN01CWklzRHFFS2xqaVZNcEtHN25wRnR2UU5vb2h0cVdZdUNqSVVL?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQWHpFZmRGaC00Qnc1UXR3b2tLR1hsR1JGYVo0ZEFMYzlQSzQxOWR5SXFLam54T0huU3Ewa0loVlRleFRTMWwxQ0lTSDJheExYN0F4TVBXVWpTczRER090Z3ZtalhiV0Vob0VfRHhDcjNlNmVvUzZKaUFrbVBfaEZzOTdRLUdMeDlPNUoxTGJZOG1QRTlNbU5Sa0lwZ0hNZko0QnJtT1VlQkRnaDNTRXdZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;IFEX&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQVnRQLW9OTmNWRWhiZVdtTFE0MzJMVnE2azM2UEZoUGtlRDZBekdqaUY5cWNvUFlsS2R6SWZ6ei1OV0dEaG51VElPamVGN1BpcTRFdG1xSlRGTFU3V213bFcwemJGbEE5X2NCX1hSUkpCSUVGSkpXc2w0YVhwUHNFZWEwakhhMFJ0RzBfNFJfZzRvUmwyOVdsSkNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latin Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOWFowRG40dXpiaXRoYUU0QklSN0I3U2V2UHJEalBDXzJ1T2RfSzdFVlFzTHB6UHZkNEVPRlRONFdjWEVyTGxnbTJrc1BfQVVBdkU0WlRsRG5WVHRmRzFKMWNyQWZ2QkRsVENFR00wbGFVd0MtVE1QejVNOERUSF9NbzFfSjVjWTFmdndReTFFN